    {
      "id": "i4y54th",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Balanced Diet"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ugwzl0p",
      "content": "• A balanced diet contains all nutrients in correct proportions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fzh60uo",
      "content": "• It includes cereals, fruits, vegetables, milk, proteins and fats."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mrc8gj6",
      "content": "• It is essential for maintaining health."
    },
    {
      "id": "zw9pl17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Malnutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1syg0hi",
      "content": "• Malnutrition occurs due to lack of proper nutrients."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "afmi7g9",
      "content": "• It may result from undernutrition or overnutrition."
    },
    {
